    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Kill Rig",
    "summary": "A psychic level 1 ability. During your Movement phase, if a unit embarked in this unit is chosen for a disembark move, provided this unit is not itself battle-shocked, you may make a psychic roll of one D6 for it. If you do, a 1 battle-shocks this unit, and either way attacks made by the disembarking unit against MONSTER or VEHICLE units get +1 to their Wound rolls until the turn ends.",
